    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Tell AI Your Vision\r\n\r\nNow it's your turn. Every website starts as a vision - and your job is to communicate it clearly.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1. **Compose your vision** as a message to AI Tutor. Cover all of these:\r\n   - What the website is **about**\r\n   - **2-3 things** it must include\r\n   - The **tone** (fun? serious? cozy?)\r\n   - The **colors** you want\r\n   - **Why** you're making it\r\n2. **Send it** and ask AI Tutor to build the page.\r\n3. **Look at the first draft.** If it's roughly right, click **Accept**.\r\n\r\n> **Tip:** The more specific your vision, the closer the first draft. \"A bright, cheerful page about my dog Milo with a story about how we met\" beats \"a page about dogs\".\r\n\r\nDon't polish yet! The goal is a first draft - you'll come back to perfect it later. Once you accept the draft, click **Continue**.",
    "submittable": "false",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
